{
    "title": "Influenster",
    "description": "Influenster: Free products. For everyone.\r\n\r\nLove a freebie? You\u2019re in the right place.\r\nInfluenster partners with top brands to send you their latest products, and we only ask that you share your experience in return. Most of the free products we send are full size (not samples!) because we\u2019re cool like that.\r\n\r\nGet started:\r\n1. Download the app and sign up.\r\n2. Answer a few questions about your tastes (that way, we\u2019ll only send you stuff you\u2019ll love.)\r\n3. Start getting free products in one of our VoxBoxes!\r\n\r\nFrequent Q\u2019s:\r\nDo I have to pay for anything? \r\nWe won\u2019t ask for payment details, all the products we send are free. \r\n\r\nWhat kind of products can I try?\r\nAlmost everything. Skincare, latest tech, toys, premium drinks, pet products,\u2026 You name it!\r\n\r\nWhat do I do once I get a VoxBox? \r\nGet excited! Receiving free products is about to become your favorite thing. After opening your parcel, check your tasks. Usually, it\u2019s a simple review or a post on social media.\r\nComplete your tasks by the due date and continue getting more freebies!\r\n\r\nWhat\u2019s the best thing about Influenster?\r\nOther than claiming free, full-size products?\r\nIt\u2019s a great community where you can get REAL member reviews about thousands of products. If you have your eye on something, check the reviews first. Know before you buy, and never regret a purchase again.\r\n\r\nAnd...If you're ready to create content and grow your following - Join Influenster Pro to qualify for even more products and get discovered by top brands and create partnerships.\r\n\r\nDownload\u200b the Influenster app today!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Influenster: Free products. For everyone.<br><br>Love a freebie? You\u2019re in the right place.<br>Influenster partners with top brands to send you their latest products, and we only ask that you share your experience in return. Most of the free products we send are full size (not samples!) because we\u2019re cool like that.<br><br>Get started:<br>1. Download the app and sign up.<br>2. Answer a few questions about your tastes (that way, we\u2019ll only send you stuff you\u2019ll love.)<br>3. Start getting free products in one of our VoxBoxes!<br><br>Frequent Q\u2019s:<br>Do I have to pay for anything? <br>We won\u2019t ask for payment details, all the products we send are free. <br><br>What kind of products can I try?<br>Almost everything. Skincare, latest tech, toys, premium drinks, pet products,\u2026 You name it!<br><br>What do I do once I get a VoxBox? <br>Get excited! Receiving free products is about to become your favorite thing. After opening your parcel, check your tasks. Usually, it\u2019s a simple review or a post on social media.<br>Complete your tasks by the due date and continue getting more freebies!<br><br>What\u2019s the best thing about Influenster?<br>Other than claiming free, full-size products?<br>It\u2019s a great community where you can get REAL member reviews about thousands of products. If you have your eye on something, check the reviews first. Know before you buy, and never regret a purchase again.<br><br>And...If you&#39;re ready to create content and grow your following - Join Influenster Pro to qualify for even more products and get discovered by top brands and create partnerships.<br><br>Download\u200b the Influenster app today!",
